  "title": "Better Adventures+",
  "description": "100+ mods that enhance the Vanilla experience.",
  "body": "Want to host a Minecraft server? https://flow.bloom.host/\n\n![Bloom Hosting](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8348b80f4dd78886a0a55ec7fde97675f11e962e.png)\n\nWe all love Minecraft, but it can get a bit stale at times. This modpack contains over 100 mods that will enhance the Vanilla experience.\n\nYou will find dozens of quality of life mods, visual changes, added ambience, and more, which will breathe life into your worlds and builds. Take a look at some of the highlight features:\n\n- 🌍 Dozens of new biomes and overhauled terrain across all dimensions\n- 🛠️ A full job system with 10 professions, unique perks, and specialized tools\n- 🎒 Quality-of-life improvements like inventory sorting, audio ambience, and sacks (shulkers)\n- 🌅 Breathtaking visuals via Atmospherics, Shine, and Voxy. No shaders required!\n- 🏰 Dozens of new structures to discover and explore throughout the world\n- ✨ New animations for mobs and the player, bringing the world to life\n\nAdditional Content Credits:\n- VanillaTweaks: https://vanillatweaks.net/\n- Eclipse Shaders: https://github.com/Merlin1809/Eclipse-Shader\n\nSome links in this description are affiliate links; purchases made through these links will earn me a commision.",
